  "details": "- CVE-2026-27651: properly clear s->passwd in mail auth http requests to\n  fix a null pointer dereference on CRAM-MD5/APOP retry\n- CVE-2026-27654: validate the Destination length for Dav COPY and MOVE to\n  prevent an integer underflow and heap buffer overwrite when alias is used\n- CVE-2026-27654: also require the COPY/MOVE Destination to match the aliased\n  location prefix, and tighten ngx_http_map_uri_to_path() accordingly\n- CVE-2026-27784: fix a possible integer overflow on 32-bit platforms while\n  validating mp4 atom entry counts",
